# deterministic-agents-workflow — HTTP request collection
# Works with: HTTPie Desktop · VS Code REST Client · JetBrains HTTP Client
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

@agentBase    = http://localhost:8080
@mcpBase      = http://localhost:3001
@mcpProtocol  = 2026-07-28


# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  Health
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Health Check
GET {{agentBase}}/health


# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  Trade Failures
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### 1) T-100 — Known deterministic (Missing ISIN)
POST {{agentBase}}/trade/failures
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tradeId": "T-100",
  "reason": "Missing ISIN"
}

### 2) T-200 — Unknown failure (agent classification)
POST {{agentBase}}/trade/failures
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tradeId": "T-200",
  "reason": "LEI not found in registry"
}

### 3) T-500 — Settlement amount mismatch · FX root-cause hypothesis (4 steps)
POST {{agentBase}}/trade/failures
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tradeId": "T-500",
  "reason": "Settlement amount mismatch detected"
}

### 4) T-600 — Duplicate trade detection · risk exposure analysis (4 steps)
POST {{agentBase}}/trade/failures
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tradeId": "T-600",
  "reason": "Possible duplicate trade execution"
}

### 5) T-700 — Regulatory T+1 deadline · compliance urgency (4 steps)
POST {{agentBase}}/trade/failures
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tradeId": "T-700",
  "reason": "Regulatory T+1 deadline at risk"
}

### 6) T-800 — Sanctions screening · adaptive false-positive analysis (5 steps)
POST {{agentBase}}/trade/failures
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tradeId": "T-800",
  "reason": "OFAC screening flag on counterparty"
}

### 7) T-900 — Multi-leg cascade · structural reasoning (5 steps)
POST {{agentBase}}/trade/failures
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tradeId": "T-900",
  "reason": "Linked trade cascade failure on swap leg"
}

### 8) T-1000 — Counterparty credit event · portfolio analysis (5 steps)
POST {{agentBase}}/trade/failures
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tradeId": "T-1000",
  "reason": "Counterparty credit downgrade to CCC+"
}


# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  MCP — stateless mcp-vertx Streamable HTTP (2026-07-28)
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### MCP 1) Discover capabilities
POST {{mcpBase}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
MCP-Protocol-Version: {{mcpProtocol}}
Mcp-Method: server/discover

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": "discover-1",
  "method": "server/discover",
  "params": {
    "_meta": {
      "io.modelcontextprotocol/protocolVersion": "{{mcpProtocol}}",
      "io.modelcontextprotocol/clientInfo": { "name": "http-client", "version": "1.0" },
      "io.modelcontextprotocol/clientCapabilities": {}
    }
  }
}

### MCP 2) List tools
POST {{mcpBase}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
MCP-Protocol-Version: {{mcpProtocol}}
Mcp-Method: tools/list

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": "tools-1",
  "method": "tools/list",
  "params": {
    "_meta": {
      "io.modelcontextprotocol/protocolVersion": "{{mcpProtocol}}",
      "io.modelcontextprotocol/clientInfo": { "name": "http-client", "version": "1.0" },
      "io.modelcontextprotocol/clientCapabilities": {}
    }
  }
}

### MCP 3) Invoke tool — case.raiseTicket
POST {{mcpBase}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
MCP-Protocol-Version: {{mcpProtocol}}
Mcp-Method: tools/call
Mcp-Name: case.raiseTicket

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": "call-1",
  "method": "tools/call",
  "params": {
    "_meta": {
      "io.modelcontextprotocol/protocolVersion": "{{mcpProtocol}}",
      "io.modelcontextprotocol/clientInfo": { "name": "http-client", "version": "1.0" },
      "io.modelcontextprotocol/clientCapabilities": {}
    },
    "name": "case.raiseTicket",
    "arguments": {
      "tradeId": "T-300",
      "category": "ReferenceData",
      "summary": "MCP test"
    }
  }
}
